  "identifier": "komamri",
  "name": "KomaMRI.jl",
  "description": "GPU-accelerated, Pulseq-compatible framework written in Julia for simulating Magnetic Resonance Imaging acquisitions from the Bloch equations. Aimed at reproducible MRI sequence development, reconstruction research, and education, with a graphical interface and open, well-documented code.",
